OL,3,GNEWSANowak family say police footage
OL,4,Adeepened trauma
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of Henry Nowak have said the
OL,7,Ftrauma of learning he had been murdered
OL,8,Fwas made worse by watching police
OL,9,Ffootage of officers handcuffing him as
OL,10,Fhe lay dying.
OL,12,FThey told ITV their "world has changed
OL,13,Ftwice", first when they were told he
OL,14,Fhad died, and again when they watched
OL,15,Fthe body-worn camera video.
OL,17,FHis killer, Vickrum Digwa, falsely told
OL,18,Fpolice Henry had racially abused him,
OL,19,Fand officers handcuffed the student as
OL,20,Fhe repeatedly said he had been stabbed.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
